It's made of three spacecraft arranged in a triangle and the spacecraft of flying informations that they stay exactly

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:48.540
The same distance away from each other

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:51.599
Each one has two gold platinum cubes in the middle

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:56.879
Which a test message which are essentially mirrors which bounce the lasers back and forth from the other spacecraft

